{"id":41,"date":"2017-04-09T03:49:01","date_gmt":"2017-04-09T03:49:01","guid":{"rendered":"https:\/\/kiierr.com\/?page_id=41"},"modified":"2025-01-28T14:36:26","modified_gmt":"2025-01-28T21:36:26","slug":"contact-us","status":"publish","type":"page","link":"https:\/\/kiierr.com\/contact-us\/","title":{"rendered":"Contact Us"},"content":{"rendered":"\n\t<section class=\"section\" id=\"section_1218695311\">\n\t\t<div class=\"section-bg fill\" >\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\n\n\t\t<\/div>\n\n\t\t\n\n\t\t<div class=\"section-content relative\">\n\t\t\t\n<div class=\"row row-collapse\"  id=\"row-1202771279\">\n\n\t<div id=\"col-599789126\" class=\"col small-12 large-12\"  >\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"col-inner\"  >\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\n\t<div id=\"text-143865388\" class=\"text\">\n\t\t\n<h1 class=\"thin-font\"><strong>Do you need to <\/strong> <em>contact us<\/em>?<\/h1>\n\t\t\n<style>\n#text-143865388 {\n  text-align: center;\n  color: rgb(0,0,0);\n}\n#text-143865388 > * {\n  color: rgb(0,0,0);\n}\n<\/style>\n\t<\/div>\n\t\n\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\n\t\n<\/div>\n\t\t<\/div>\n\n\t\t\n<style>\n#section_1218695311 {\n  padding-top: 30px;\n  padding-bottom: 30px;\n  background-color: rgb(237, 229, 221);\n}\n<\/style>\n\t<\/section>\n\t\n<div class=\"row\"  id=\"row-1708931269\">\n\n\t<div id=\"col-86444324\" class=\"col small-12 large-12\"  >\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"col-inner\"  >\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\n\t<div id=\"text-1473605913\" class=\"text\">\n\t\t\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\">Please click <span style=\"text-decoration: underline;\"><strong><a href=\"https:\/\/kiierr.customerdesk.io\">here<\/a><\/strong><\/span> to submit a ticket or to speakwith a live representative.<br \/>\nAll messages are responded to the same business day.&nbsp;<\/p>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\">Thank you for contacting us! We look forward to assisting you!<\/p>\n\t\t\n<style>\n#text-1473605913 {\n  text-align: center;\n  color: rgb(0,0,0);\n}\n#text-1473605913 > * {\n  color: rgb(0,0,0);\n}\n<\/style>\n\t<\/div>\n\t\n\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\n\t\n<\/div>\n\n\t<section class=\"section\" id=\"section_403625643\">\n\t\t<div class=\"section-bg fill\" >\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\n\n\t\t<\/div>\n\n\t\t\n\n\t\t<div class=\"section-content relative\">\n\t\t\t\n<div class=\"row row-collapse\"  id=\"row-410673706\">\n\n\t<div id=\"col-534772664\" class=\"col small-12 large-12\"  >\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"col-inner\"  >\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\n\t<div id=\"text-687158004\" class=\"text\">\n\t\t\n<h1 class=\"thin-font\"><strong>Additional <\/strong> <em>Information <\/em><\/h1>\n\t\t\n<style>\n#text-687158004 {\n  text-align: center;\n  color: rgb(0,0,0);\n}\n#text-687158004 > * {\n  color: rgb(0,0,0);\n}\n<\/style>\n\t<\/div>\n\t\n\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\n\t\n<\/div>\n\t\t<\/div>\n\n\t\t\n<style>\n#section_403625643 {\n  padding-top: 30px;\n  padding-bottom: 30px;\n  background-color: rgb(237, 229, 221);\n}\n<\/style>\n\t<\/section>\n\t\n<div class=\"row\"  id=\"row-844460960\">\n\n\t<div id=\"col-285547835\" class=\"col small-12 large-12\"  >\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"col-inner\"  >\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\n<div class=\"row align-middle\"  id=\"row-2139791186\">\n\n\t<div id=\"col-56111970\" class=\"col hgjhgjghj medium-6 small-12 large-6\"  >\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"col-inner\"  >\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\n\t<div id=\"text-2812851615\" class=\"text\">\n\t\t\n<h1 class=\"thin-font\"><strong>Do you have <\/strong> <em>questions?<\/em><\/h1>\n\t\t\n<style>\n#text-2812851615 {\n  text-align: center;\n  color: rgb(0,0,0);\n}\n#text-2812851615 > * {\n  color: rgb(0,0,0);\n}\n<\/style>\n\t<\/div>\n\t\n<div class=\"accordion\">\n\t<div id=\"accordion-3487901045\" class=\"accordion-item\">\n\t\t<a id=\"accordion-3487901045-label\" class=\"accordion-title plain\" href=\"#accordion-item-contact-details\" aria-expanded=\"false\" aria-controls=\"accordion-3487901045-content\" >\n\t\t\t<button class=\"toggle\" aria-label=\"Toggle\"><i class=\"icon-angle-down\"><\/i><\/button>\n\t\t\t<span>Contact Details<\/span>\n\t\t<\/a>\n\t\t<div id=\"accordion-3487901045-content\" class=\"accordion-inner\" aria-labelledby=\"accordion-3487901045-label\" >\n\t\t\t\n\t<div id=\"text-2500188731\" class=\"text\">\n\t\t\n<p>Sales Department<\/p>\n<p><a href=\"mailto:sales@kiierr.com\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">sales@kiierr.com<\/a><\/p>\n<p>ServiceDepartment<\/p>\n<p><a href=\"mailto:service@kiierr.com\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">service@kiierr.com<\/a><\/p>\n<p><strong>801-834-4970<\/strong><\/p>\n<p>Our normal business hours are M-F, 9-5 MST<\/p>\n<p>All emails are responded to the same business day. Be sure to check your spam folder if you do not see a response. You can also chat with a live representative on the Kiierr website.<\/p>\n\t\t\n<style>\n#text-2500188731 {\n  color: rgb(0,0,0);\n}\n#text-2500188731 > * {\n  color: rgb(0,0,0);\n}\n<\/style>\n\t<\/div>\n\t\n\t\t<\/div>\n\t<\/div>\n\t\n\t<div id=\"accordion-4252046750\" class=\"accordion-item\">\n\t\t<a id=\"accordion-4252046750-label\" class=\"accordion-title plain\" href=\"#accordion-item-shipping-information\" aria-expanded=\"false\" aria-controls=\"accordion-4252046750-content\" >\n\t\t\t<button class=\"toggle\" aria-label=\"Toggle\"><i class=\"icon-angle-down\"><\/i><\/button>\n\t\t\t<span>Shipping Information<\/span>\n\t\t<\/a>\n\t\t<div id=\"accordion-4252046750-content\" class=\"accordion-inner\" aria-labelledby=\"accordion-4252046750-label\" >\n\t\t\t\n\t<div id=\"text-428941806\" class=\"text\">\n\t\t\n<p>Orders ship within 2-3 business days via USPS Priority or FedEx. Shipping within the US is free. <\/p>\n<p>We ship to all countries and international shipping is $55 USD (plus customs fees charged by FedEx)<\/p>\n\t\t\n<style>\n#text-428941806 {\n  color: rgb(0,0,0);\n}\n#text-428941806 > * {\n  color: rgb(0,0,0);\n}\n<\/style>\n\t<\/div>\n\t\n\t\t<\/div>\n\t<\/div>\n\t\n\t<div id=\"accordion-4283629437\" class=\"accordion-item\">\n\t\t<a id=\"accordion-4283629437-label\" class=\"accordion-title plain\" href=\"#accordion-item-warranty\" aria-expanded=\"false\" aria-controls=\"accordion-4283629437-content\" >\n\t\t\t<button class=\"toggle\" aria-label=\"Toggle\"><i class=\"icon-angle-down\"><\/i><\/button>\n\t\t\t<span>Warranty<\/span>\n\t\t<\/a>\n\t\t<div id=\"accordion-4283629437-content\" class=\"accordion-inner\" aria-labelledby=\"accordion-4283629437-label\" >\n\t\t\t\n\t<div id=\"text-3132000610\" class=\"text\">\n\t\t\n<p>Our 2-year warranty begins on the delivery date and covers defects in materials, workmanship, and product failures under normal use.<\/p>\n<p>Not Covered: Damage from misuse, abuse, accidents, or unauthorized repairs. Normal wear and tear, cosmetic damage, loss, or theft.<\/p>\n<p>For claims, contact our service department via email at <a href=\"service@kiierr.com\">service@kiierr.com<\/a><\/p>\n\t\t\n<style>\n#text-3132000610 {\n  color: rgb(0,0,0);\n}\n#text-3132000610 > * {\n  color: rgb(0,0,0);\n}\n<\/style>\n\t<\/div>\n\t\n\t\t<\/div>\n\t<\/div>\n\t\n\t<div id=\"accordion-2926617401\" class=\"accordion-item\">\n\t\t<a id=\"accordion-2926617401-label\" class=\"accordion-title plain\" href=\"#accordion-item-returns\" aria-expanded=\"false\" aria-controls=\"accordion-2926617401-content\" >\n\t\t\t<button class=\"toggle\" aria-label=\"Toggle\"><i class=\"icon-angle-down\"><\/i><\/button>\n\t\t\t<span>Returns<\/span>\n\t\t<\/a>\n\t\t<div id=\"accordion-2926617401-content\" class=\"accordion-inner\" aria-labelledby=\"accordion-2926617401-label\" >\n\t\t\t\n\t<div id=\"text-2140212685\" class=\"text\">\n\t\t\n<p><strong>7-Month Growth Guarantee:<\/strong> Use your laser cap consistently for 210 days. If no growth is seen, return it within 210-240 days for a refund (25% fee, waived if 7 month photo documentation is provided). Registration with a before photo is required within 45 days of receiving the cap. See full policy for details.<br \/>Warranty:Kiierr laser caps come with a 2-year warranty, which covers any defects or failures.<\/p>\n<p><a href=\"https:\/\/kiierr.com\/refund-policy\/\">Read Full Return Policy<\/a><\/p>\n\t\t\n<style>\n#text-2140212685 {\n  color: rgb(0,0,0);\n}\n#text-2140212685 > * {\n  color: rgb(0,0,0);\n}\n<\/style>\n\t<\/div>\n\t\n\t\t<\/div>\n\t<\/div>\n\t\n\t<div id=\"accordion-354567845\" class=\"accordion-item\">\n\t\t<a id=\"accordion-354567845-label\" class=\"accordion-title plain\" href=\"#accordion-item-troubleshooting\" aria-expanded=\"false\" aria-controls=\"accordion-354567845-content\" >\n\t\t\t<button class=\"toggle\" aria-label=\"Toggle\"><i class=\"icon-angle-down\"><\/i><\/button>\n\t\t\t<span>Troubleshooting<\/span>\n\t\t<\/a>\n\t\t<div id=\"accordion-354567845-content\" class=\"accordion-inner\" aria-labelledby=\"accordion-354567845-label\" >\n\t\t\t\n\t<div id=\"text-1233240719\" class=\"text\">\n\t\t\n<p>For comprehensive troubleshooting instructions for the various Kiierr devices, follow this link <a href=\"https:\/\/kiierr.com\/how-to-use\/\">here<\/a>.<\/p>\n\t\t\n<style>\n#text-1233240719 {\n  color: rgb(0,0,0);\n}\n#text-1233240719 > * {\n  color: rgb(0,0,0);\n}\n<\/style>\n\t<\/div>\n\t\n\t\t<\/div>\n\t<\/div>\n\t\n<\/div>\n\t<div id=\"text-343159176\" class=\"text rfdgdfg\">\n\t\t\n<p><a href=\"#faq\"><strong>FAQS<\/strong><\/a><\/p>\n\t\t\n<style>\n#text-343159176 {\n  color: rgb(0,0,0);\n}\n#text-343159176 > * {\n  color: rgb(0,0,0);\n}\n<\/style>\n\t<\/div>\n\t\n\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\n\t\n\n\t<div id=\"col-485275533\" class=\"col medium-6 small-12 large-6\"  >\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"col-inner text-center\"  >\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\n\t<div class=\"img has-hover x md-x lg-x y md-y lg-y\" id=\"image_346595113\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"img-inner dark\" >\n\t\t\t<img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"604\" height=\"504\" src=\"https:\/\/kiierr.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/11\/Beige-Aesthetic-Contact-Us-Instagram-Post-2.png\" class=\"attachment-original size-original\" alt=\"\" srcset=\"https:\/\/kiierr.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/11\/Beige-Aesthetic-Contact-Us-Instagram-Post-2.png 604w, https:\/\/kiierr.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/11\/Beige-Aesthetic-Contact-Us-Instagram-Post-2-300x250.png 300w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 604px) 100vw, 604px\" \/>\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\n<style>\n#image_346595113 {\n  width: 100%;\n}\n@media (min-width:550px) {\n  #image_346595113 {\n    width: 73%;\n  }\n}\n<\/style>\n\t<\/div>\n\t\n\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\n\t\n<\/div>\n\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\n\t\n<\/div>\n<span class=\"scroll-to\" data-label=\"Scroll to: #faq\" data-bullet=\"false\" data-link=\"#faq\" data-title=\"Change this\" ><a name=\"faq\"><\/a><\/span>\n\n\t<section class=\"section\" id=\"section_543871941\">\n\t\t<div class=\"section-bg fill\" >\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\n\n\t\t<\/div>\n\n\t\t\n\n\t\t<div class=\"section-content relative\">\n\t\t\t\n<div class=\"row row-collapse\"  id=\"row-247832140\">\n\n\t<div id=\"col-1132012180\" class=\"col small-12 large-12\"  >\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"col-inner\"  >\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\n\t<div id=\"text-3967248256\" class=\"text\">\n\t\t\n<h1 class=\"thin-font\"><strong>Frequently Asked <\/strong> <em>Questions <\/em>?<\/h1>\n\t\t\n<style>\n#text-3967248256 {\n  text-align: center;\n  color: rgb(0,0,0);\n}\n#text-3967248256 > * {\n  color: rgb(0,0,0);\n}\n<\/style>\n\t<\/div>\n\t\n\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\n\t\n<\/div>\n<div class=\"row\"  id=\"row-525907875\">\n\n\t<div id=\"col-1371806103\" class=\"col small-12 large-12\"  >\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"col-inner\"  >\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\n<div class=\"row align-middle\"  id=\"row-1766207077\">\n\n\t<div id=\"col-1273313201\" class=\"col medium-6 small-12 large-6\"  >\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"col-inner\"  >\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\n\t<div class=\"img has-hover x md-x lg-x y md-y lg-y\" id=\"image_236487241\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"img-inner dark\" >\n\t\t\t<img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"2118\" height=\"1566\" src=\"https:\/\/kiierr.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/11\/Kiierr_XL_Dark_02-1.png\" class=\"attachment-original size-original\" alt=\"\" srcset=\"https:\/\/kiierr.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/11\/Kiierr_XL_Dark_02-1.png 2118w, https:\/\/kiierr.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/11\/Kiierr_XL_Dark_02-1-300x222.png 300w, https:\/\/kiierr.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/11\/Kiierr_XL_Dark_02-1-1024x757.png 1024w, https:\/\/kiierr.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/11\/Kiierr_XL_Dark_02-1-768x568.png 768w, https:\/\/kiierr.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/11\/Kiierr_XL_Dark_02-1-1536x1136.png 1536w, https:\/\/kiierr.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/11\/Kiierr_XL_Dark_02-1-2048x1514.png 2048w, https:\/\/kiierr.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/11\/Kiierr_XL_Dark_02-1-800x592.png 800w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 2118px) 100vw, 2118px\" \/>\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\n<style>\n#image_236487241 {\n  width: 100%;\n}\n<\/style>\n\t<\/div>\n\t\n\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\n\t\n\n\t<div id=\"col-964542624\" class=\"col gfdgfdg medium-6 small-12 large-6\"  >\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"col-inner\"  >\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\n<div class=\"accordion\">\n\t<div id=\"accordion-2602309081\" class=\"accordion-item\">\n\t\t<a id=\"accordion-2602309081-label\" class=\"accordion-title plain\" href=\"#accordion-item-will-laser-therapy-work-for-my-type-of-hair-loss?\" aria-expanded=\"false\" aria-controls=\"accordion-2602309081-content\" >\n\t\t\t<button class=\"toggle\" aria-label=\"Toggle\"><i class=\"icon-angle-down\"><\/i><\/button>\n\t\t\t<span>Will laser therapy work for my type of hair loss?<\/span>\n\t\t<\/a>\n\t\t<div id=\"accordion-2602309081-content\" class=\"accordion-inner\" aria-labelledby=\"accordion-2602309081-label\" >\n\t\t\t\n\t<div id=\"text-2045275243\" class=\"text\">\n\t\t\n<p>Absolutely! The great thing about Low-Level Light Therapy (LLLT) is its versatility! Whether you are male or female, 18 or 88, from pattern baldness to hair thinning due to stress or medical conditions like including alopecia areata, hormonal imbalances, telogen effluvium and so much more.<\/p>\n<p>Users of all hair textures and skin tones have seen incredible results, regardless of age. Start your journey to thicker, healthier hair today and see why so many trust Kiierr for their hair growth needs!<\/p>\n\t\t\n<style>\n#text-2045275243 {\n  color: rgb(0,0,0);\n}\n#text-2045275243 > * {\n  color: rgb(0,0,0);\n}\n<\/style>\n\t<\/div>\n\t\n\t\t<\/div>\n\t<\/div>\n\t\n\t<div id=\"accordion-4218329454\" class=\"accordion-item\">\n\t\t<a id=\"accordion-4218329454-label\" class=\"accordion-title plain\" href=\"#accordion-item-which-laser-cap-should-i-choose?\" aria-expanded=\"false\" aria-controls=\"accordion-4218329454-content\" >\n\t\t\t<button class=\"toggle\" aria-label=\"Toggle\"><i class=\"icon-angle-down\"><\/i><\/button>\n\t\t\t<span>Which laser cap should I choose?<\/span>\n\t\t<\/a>\n\t\t<div id=\"accordion-4218329454-content\" class=\"accordion-inner\" aria-labelledby=\"accordion-4218329454-label\" >\n\t\t\t\n\t<div id=\"text-2061929206\" class=\"text\">\n\t\t\n<p>We have 4 laser cap options: 148 Pro, 272 Premier, 272 MD Elite, and 302 MD Ultra Flex. Choosing the right cap depends on your specific needs. For early stages of hair loss or those on a budget who are okay with slower, steadier results, the 148 Pro is ideal. If you&#8217;re seeking more significant and quicker regrowth, the 272 Premier is our bestseller.<\/p>\n<p>For larger head sizes or extensive coverage, the 272 MD Elite is perfect. Lastly, the 302 MD Ultra Flex offers the fastest results and superior comfort. Ideal for severe hair loss, this model also offers a soft flex fit for maximum comfort.<\/p>\n\t\t\n<style>\n#text-2061929206 {\n  color: rgb(0,0,0);\n}\n#text-2061929206 > * {\n  color: rgb(0,0,0);\n}\n<\/style>\n\t<\/div>\n\t\n\t\t<\/div>\n\t<\/div>\n\t\n\t<div id=\"accordion-254576204\" class=\"accordion-item\">\n\t\t<a id=\"accordion-254576204-label\" class=\"accordion-title plain\" href=\"#accordion-item-how-long-will-it-take-to-see-results?\" aria-expanded=\"false\" aria-controls=\"accordion-254576204-content\" >\n\t\t\t<button class=\"toggle\" aria-label=\"Toggle\"><i class=\"icon-angle-down\"><\/i><\/button>\n\t\t\t<span>How long will it take to see results?<\/span>\n\t\t<\/a>\n\t\t<div id=\"accordion-254576204-content\" class=\"accordion-inner\" aria-labelledby=\"accordion-254576204-label\" >\n\t\t\t\n\t<div id=\"text-3587248503\" class=\"text\">\n\t\t\n<p>Results vary, but most users see noticeable improvements within 6-12 weeks. We\u2019re so confident in our product that we offer a 7-month growth guarantee\u2014if you don\u2019t see results, you can return the cap!<\/p>\n<p>Laser therapy is a safe, non-invasive, and natural way to treat hair loss before considering more drastic measures like medications or surgery.<\/p>\n\t\t\n<style>\n#text-3587248503 {\n  color: rgb(0,0,0);\n}\n#text-3587248503 > * {\n  color: rgb(0,0,0);\n}\n<\/style>\n\t<\/div>\n\t\n\t\t<\/div>\n\t<\/div>\n\t\n\t<div id=\"accordion-1613969794\" class=\"accordion-item\">\n\t\t<a id=\"accordion-1613969794-label\" class=\"accordion-title plain\" href=\"#accordion-item-why-should-i-buy-your-cap-vs-competitors?\" aria-expanded=\"false\" aria-controls=\"accordion-1613969794-content\" >\n\t\t\t<button class=\"toggle\" aria-label=\"Toggle\"><i class=\"icon-angle-down\"><\/i><\/button>\n\t\t\t<span>Why should I buy your cap vs competitors?<\/span>\n\t\t<\/a>\n\t\t<div id=\"accordion-1613969794-content\" class=\"accordion-inner\" aria-labelledby=\"accordion-1613969794-label\" >\n\t\t\t\n\t<div id=\"text-3313718235\" class=\"text\">\n\t\t\n<p>Choosing Kiierr is like joining a family &#038; community committed to hair recovery. Since 2017, we&#8217;ve provided top-quality, medical-grade laser caps with a solid 2-year warranty. With our 7-month growth guarantee, you can trust that we&#8217;re as invested in your hair journey as you are.<\/p>\n<p>Our exceptional customer service is always ready to support your journey; real people who genuinely care, ready to guide, support, and celebrate your progress with you.<\/p>\n\t\t\n<style>\n#text-3313718235 {\n  color: rgb(0,0,0);\n}\n#text-3313718235 > * {\n  color: rgb(0,0,0);\n}\n<\/style>\n\t<\/div>\n\t\n\t\t<\/div>\n\t<\/div>\n\t\n\t<div id=\"accordion-2393883896\" class=\"accordion-item\">\n\t\t<a id=\"accordion-2393883896-label\" class=\"accordion-title plain\" href=\"#accordion-item-do-you-offer-payment-plans?\" aria-expanded=\"false\" aria-controls=\"accordion-2393883896-content\" >\n\t\t\t<button class=\"toggle\" aria-label=\"Toggle\"><i class=\"icon-angle-down\"><\/i><\/button>\n\t\t\t<span>Do you offer payment plans?<\/span>\n\t\t<\/a>\n\t\t<div id=\"accordion-2393883896-content\" class=\"accordion-inner\" aria-labelledby=\"accordion-2393883896-label\" >\n\t\t\t\n\t<div id=\"text-4120752491\" class=\"text\">\n\t\t\n<p>Yes! We offer flexible payment options through Affirm, Afterpay, and PayPal Pay Later, providing easy monthly installments or delayed full payments to suit your financial situation.<\/p>\n<ul>\n<li>Affirm allows you to split your purchase into easy monthly payments with interest rates as low as 0% APR.<\/li>\n<li>Afterpay allows you to split your purchase into four equal installments, due every two weeks, no interest or fees.<br \/>PayPal Pay Later, you can choose to pay in full within 6 months with no interest, or make minimum monthly payments with interest.<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<p>Just pick what works for you at checkout!<\/p>\n\t\t\n<style>\n#text-4120752491 {\n  color: rgb(0,0,0);\n}\n#text-4120752491 > * {\n  color: rgb(0,0,0);\n}\n<\/style>\n\t<\/div>\n\t\n\t\t<\/div>\n\t<\/div>\n\t\n<\/div>\n\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\n\t\n<\/div>\n\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\n\t\n<\/div>\n\t\t<\/div>\n\n\t\t\n<style>\n#section_543871941 {\n  padding-top: 30px;\n  padding-bottom: 30px;\n  background-color: rgb(237, 229, 221);\n}\n<\/style>\n\t<\/section>\n\t\n<div class=\"row\" 